{1}{[This brutish looking orc gazes at you through heavy lids. He looks every bit the primitive orc.] Ugh. I Gar, world smartest orc. You have got question?}{[This brutish looking orc gazes at you through heavy lids. He looks every bit the primitive orc.] Ugh. I Gar, world smartest orc. You have got question?}{}{1}{}{gf1089 1 }
