{35}{[Gar's demeanor seems to change. His eyes open fully, and he seems to take on the manner of a foppish gentleman.] Oh, come now, that is rubbish! Green tea is for the foreign constitution, not for consumption by those with discerning...uh [he seems to realize something.] I mean, uhm Uhg. Gar no like green tea.}{[Gar's demeanor seems to change. His eyes open fully, and he seems to take on the manner of a foppish gentleman.] Oh, come now, that is rubbish! Green tea is for the foreign constitution, not for consumption by those with discerning...uh [he seems to realize something.] I mean, uhm Uhg. Gar no like green tea.}{}{4}{}{ }
