{45}{Gar not idiot. Gar smart. [He looks around to make certain no one else can hear.] Listen here, sir, have you ever conversed with a pure bred orc? You'll not be in for a scintillating conversation, of that I can assure you.}{Gar not idiot. Gar smart. [He looks around to make certain no one else can hear.] Listen here, madam, have you ever conversed with a pure bred orc? You'll not be in for a scintillating conversation, of that I can assure you.}{}{5}{}{ }
