{65}{Garfield Thelonius Remington the third, of pure human stock, at your service. I am not orc at all. Well, one can assume that somewhere in lineage there exists orc blood simply from looking at me. But my direct antecedents, my parents and grandparents, were fully human. Imagine their shock when I was born.}{Garfield Thelonius Remington the third, of pure human stock, at your service. I am not orc at all. Well, one can assume that somewhere in lineage there exists orc blood simply from looking at me. But my direct antecedents, my parents and grandparents, were fully human. Imagine their shock when I was born.}{}{7}{}{gf1090 1 }
