{620}{I do not know, but I believe it is somewhere near Stillwater. We should travel to Stillwater and query the citizenry. Someone there must know where it is, I would assume.}{I do not know, but I believe it is somewhere near Stillwater. We should travel to Stillwater and query the citizenry. Someone there must know where it is, I would assume.}{}{51}{}{ }
