{625}{Majestic Caladon! The longest standing monarchy in all of Arcanum. The Farads have ruled over their prosperous kingdom for over 1000 years! They've managed to maintain their prosperity by being open to changing with the vagaries of the day - they embrace both magic and technology.}{Majestic Caladon! The longest standing monarchy in all of Arcanum. The Farads have ruled over their prosperous kingdom for over 1000 years! They've managed to maintain their prosperity by being open to changing with the vagaries of the day - they embrace both magic and technology.}{}{52}{}{ }
{626}{K:}{}{1}{}{350}{ }
{629}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{630}{Alas, poor Dernholm! Once home to the legendary Dragon Knights, it has fallen on hard times since Praetor became king some 60 odd years ago. He despises all technology, and I think he's recently become sour on magick as well.}{Alas, poor Dernholm! Once home to the legendary Dragon Knights, it has fallen on hard times since Praetor became king some 60 odd years ago. He despises all technology, and I think he's recently become sour on magick as well.}{}{53}{}{ }
{631}{K:}{}{1}{}{350}{ }
{634}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{635}{Qintarra, "City of the Air" in the old elven tongue. Oldest elven city in all of Arcanum.}{Qintarra, "City of the Air" in the old elven tongue. Oldest elven city in all of Arcanum.}{}{54}{}{ }
{636}{I wasn't aware you knew the "old elven tongue".}{}{5}{}{640}{ }
{637}{K:}{}{1}{}{350}{ }
