{640}{Well, I wouldn't say I'm fluent in it, by any means, but I've picked up a few things over the years.}{Well, I wouldn't say I'm fluent in it, by any means, but I've picked up a few things over the years.}{}{55}{}{ }
{641}{K:}{}{1}{}{350}{ }
